\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {9.2}{\ignorespaces Live load beats a stale forecast under dynamic service times (Azure LLM trace, 9683 arrivals, 8 topologies per point): the forecast-free balancer is within \(2\%\) of the offline optimum at every capacity, blind following loses up to 40 points, and the prefix test recovers most of it. Ratios are against an upper bound on the offline optimum, hence conservative.}}{43}{figure.9.2}\protected@file@percent }
